@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR
    BorderColor MODEL_COLOR_T3
    FontColor USER_COLOR
}
hide empty description

[*] --> AllMembers

state "AllMembers\n(no active conditions)" as AllMembers
state "Narrowed\n(one or more conditions)" as Narrowed

AllMembers --> Narrowed : find / filter / show / findemail
Narrowed --> AllMembers : remove last chip
Narrowed --> AllMembers : list, applied add,\nsuccessful clear /all, valid import
Narrowed --> Narrowed : add or remove a condition\n[one or more conditions remain]

note left of Narrowed
Conditions combine with AND.
Within each search or tag group,
alternatives combine with OR.
Repeated name/email keyword sets,
complete tag sets, or show selections
add no condition. Keyword/tag sets
ignore case, order and repetition.
end note

note right of AllMembers
sort, delete and displayed clear
retain the active conditions.
list preserves stored order.

add/import clear conditions before saving.
A failed save retains that cleared view.
end note
@enduml
